{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d92b2eef0f691e9dc9cd5e7a4e2775db6450d93c16fd174f44f8b7e93f2d2f39", "ja": "ふぅ、やっとスケジュール調整が終わったぞ。\n仕事の依頼はありがたいけど、残業は嬉しい悲鳴だな！", "zh": "呼，终于调整完行程了。\n虽然有工作委托很令人开心，但加班真是甜蜜的负担啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "5e1011f1c46f08a964b71cc9dfda12f38d42c93fd913f3cbb7345f950752503b", "ja": "{$P$}く～ん……\nあっ、いたいた♪", "zh": "{$P$}～\n啊，找到了找到了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b61eef010df612844a101abdc71ee4a7e9ce8c5755dd083e45e1bd56acb36b9a", "ja": "莉緒？　なんだ、まだ帰ってなかったのか。\nって、衣装なんか着て、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "莉绪？怎么，原来你还没回去啊。\n看你穿着舞台服装，是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "c446413948cb181de04929752e110034316cd39d843413aca7a2f84eb9b5d89b", "ja": "あ、これ？　明日のお仕事で着るから、試着してたの。\nだって、すごく気に入ってるんだもの♪", "zh": "啊，这个吗？明天的工作要穿，我就先试穿了。\n因为我很喜欢这套服装嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "19211752276454747834581d21ea89d516af94927cb13e86bcaabed81ff003f0", "ja": "ねぇねぇ{$P$}くん、どう、似合う？\n似合うって言ってくれなきゃ、イヤイヤ～！", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}，怎么样，好看吗？\n如果你不说好看，我可不接受～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "813910da17905ee405bf5197ccbf22801253765f6e173df7b5c0ea169121779b", "ja": "強制じゃないか……いや、似合ってるとは思うけど。\nで、俺に何か用事だったんじゃないのか？", "zh": "你根本在强迫我说嘛……不过，我是觉得很好看啦。\n话说，你找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "24f4c9c9e1178302fff4c94fe9fa3be7e777bc49fb8cb7c1c7c97068c3d13d33", "ja": "あ、そうだったわ！\nこほん……あのね、{$P$}くん。", "zh": "啊，对了！\n咳……我说{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "838435ab8aa55ab10753941bd24bfec51cce42933fb0d9d1db9b2e717f028f46", "ja": "今度のことで、よくわかったの。私って、\nかなり……キミに、大事にされてたんだってコト。", "zh": "透过这次经验，我明白了。\n原来你……对我非常重视呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "86aa40a3c90cbbc7a178bf631a709b25b555f117a21bf19dde88a1f0cb4d2bef", "ja": "だから、セクシーな売り方にも慎重だったのよね？\nあ、それとも、自分だけのものにしたかったとか～？", "zh": "所以遇到需要展现性感魅力的工作时，你就会很谨慎吧？\n啊，还是说，你是想一个人独占我呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0bac416ed38d70c52c2d3cfd36ea295cc3703ae91948a65173af0f09ddf43da0", "ja": "莉緒……。", "zh": "莉绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "fbe94c55bad86e1fa3672d83e6095f8d54502859c829a60dca569d2883906fc9", "ja": "ウフフ♪　なんて、冗談だってば。\nだってなんだか、照れくさいんだもの。", "zh": "呵呵♪没什么，我开玩笑的啦。\n因为总觉得很害羞嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "94caecd3c9c6cee9fd3c6cbe10acf958a5c0cf00b2ee7198344f0310ac1f9fbc", "ja": "とにかく、ありがとね、{$P$}くん。\nこれからも、私の面倒、見てくれる？", "zh": "总而言之，谢谢你了，{$P$}。\n今后你也愿意继续关照我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "361f074782aa233d5d4e78a5906297d1f4c24963d3e07753da251bfddc4729d6", "ja": "当たり前だろ。莉緒がトップになるまで、\n俺はずっと、背中を押し続けるよ。", "zh": "那当然。直到莉绪成为顶尖偶像为止，\n我都会不断在背后协助你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "ff7536d088c70d8543874bf84089745307ee63bd07c158cc6a605b06951718b4", "ja": "ウフフ、そうよね！　……よし！\n{$P$}くん、景気づけよ！", "zh": "呵呵，就知道你会这么说！好！\n{$P$}，我们去帮彼此打打气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "c8badcd022f0fbc313aee19e56b0b02b366b468091aceb9774e9c8eb4dfc5ff5", "ja": "仕事は切り上げて、パーッと飲みに行きましょ♪\nほらほら、早く早く！", "zh": "先把工作告一段落，然后一起去喝个痛快吧♪\n来来，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0043_1016_p", "source_sha256": "96db871e0a46775b2ff039e5cd0176d409feb3d49b7cb0ba6df4a550b883504a", "ja": "いつも以上に強引だな……まあ、いいけど。\nわかったから、衣装着替えてからだぞ！", "zh": "比平常更强势呢……哎，是无所谓啦。\n我知道了，你先去把服装换下来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
